h.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Choose Experience You Can See</h2>\n            <p>The best interior designers let their finished work speak. Visit a completed home, talk to past clients and compare what each quote really includes before you decide.</p><p>Looking for a designer in Rajokri? <a href=\"/rajokri/contact\">Meet 9th Corner</a> to talk through your project.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}